Data - the actual information(Row information - Text , numbers , images , videos )
 
DBMS(Database Management System) - software that manages the database (this allows security, data integrity and interaction )

Database system - the combination of data, the DBMS and associated applications .

Common database types -  Relational databases | No SQL database | vector databases | cloud & autonomous databases

